# Shell scripts run on Linux and on the Hostinger box, never on Windows.
# core.autocrlf is on here, so without this git rewrites them to CRLF on the
# next checkout and they fail on the far end with "bad interpreter: ^M", which
# names neither the file nor the real problem.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Same reasoning: Apache reads this, and it is deployed as-is.
.htaccess text eol=lf
source.htaccess text eol=lf
